('advanced-native-1973', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1973-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["The surrounding digital environment and each pupil’s actual experience with tools."],"options":["Access to the same device model and a comparison of pupils’ scores on that model.","The surrounding digital environment and each pupil’s actual experience with tools.","The pupils’ tested skills and a later decision to introduce connected devices around them.","A common environment and a conclusion that asking about individual experience is unnecessary."]},"advanced-native-1973-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["Being born into a wired world describes their setting, not identical experience with every tool.","Connected devices being common around them does not tell us what each pupil has practised.","The report needs individual experience as well as a description of the environment.","We should base the support offered on what they have actually used, rather than on age alone."],"options":["Being born into a wired world describes their setting, not identical experience with every tool.","Connected devices being common around them does not tell us what each pupil has practised.","The report needs individual experience as well as a description of the environment.","We should base the support offered on what they have actually used, rather than on age alone."]},"advanced-native-1973-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["She can have been born into a wired world without having learnt this particular editing program."],"options":["Her unfamiliarity establishes that the community introduced digital devices only after she joined the course.","The description says she had practised the editing program before the course began.","She can have been born into a wired world without having learnt this particular editing program."]},"advanced-native-1973-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["每人已精通這次課程會用的特定工具。"],"options":["每人已精通這次課程會用的特定工具。","仍可另外了解他們的設備及使用經驗。","說話者把數碼連結視為他們出生時已有的環境部分。