('advanced-native-1974', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1974-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Screens being present in the home and the children’s actual screen use."],"options":["Screens being present in the home and the children’s actual screen use.","A shared environment and a claim that it explains the differences in individual screen use.","The children’s continuous use and the writer’s measurement of every hour.","The first recorded use of a screen as the date when the home environment began."]},"advanced-native-1974-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["Their early surroundings included connected screens, though individual use is discussed separately.","They were surrounded by it from the very beginning, with networked screens already present in the family home.","Screens were part of the home environment from the start of their childhood.","The writer places the technology around them early, without equating that with continuous use."],"options":["Their early surroundings included connected screens, though individual use is discussed separately.","They were surrounded by it from the very beginning, with networked screens already present in the family home.","Screens were part of the home environment from the start of their childhood.","The writer places the technology around them early, without equating that with continuous use."]},"advanced-native-1974-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["He could be surrounded by the technology from the very beginning of the project without operating it on the first day."],"options":["He could be surrounded by the technology from the very beginning of the project without operating it on the first day.","His first use in the second week establishes that the equipment arrived only then.","The account describes him operating the scanner from the first morning, rather than merely seeing it."]},"advanced-native-1974-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["她從起初每一刻都親自操作那件事物。"],"options":["需要從上下文確認it及所談的起點。","她從起初每一刻都親自操作那件事物。","說話者描述了早期的周圍環境。"]},"advanced-native-1974-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["They were surrounded by it from the very beginning, but we still need separate evidence of when they actually used a screen."],"options":["I assumed a device being in the room meant the child was using it whenever it was there.","I would date the start of the home environment from the first recorded use, rather than the account of screens already being there.","They were surrounded by it from the very beginning, but we still need separate evidence of when they actually used a screen."]},"advanced-native-1974-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["The sound of the village bells was part of Ah Ling’s early surroundings: she was surrounded by it from the very beginning of her childhood beside the tower. Her account does not tell us whether she ever learnt to ring the bells or how often she paid attention.","Ah Ling recalls the sound of the bells around her childhood home and says she was surrounded by it from the very beginning. This memory describes an early environment, without establishing whether she ever learnt to ring the bells."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1975', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1975-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["A practised song-selection routine, not every problem involving the tablet."],"options":["A repair procedure that they can already perform without help.","An action they have never needed to learn or practise.","Selecting a different unfamiliar playlist each day rather than practising a saved-song routine.","A practised song-selection routine, not every problem involving the tablet."]},"advanced-native-1975-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The familiar selection task is separate from the download problem they cannot yet fix alone.","They know this routine well, while asking for support with a more difficult related task.","Choosing the saved song is as natural to them as turning on the TV, though repairing a failed download still needs help.","They have practised selecting a song until it feels ordinary and easy."],"options":["The familiar selection task is separate from the download problem they cannot yet fix alone.","They know this routine well, while asking for support with a more difficult related task.","Choosing the saved song is as natural to them as turning on the TV, though repairing a failed download still needs help.","They have practised selecting a song until it feels ordinary and easy."]},"advanced-native-1975-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["One smooth attempt does not establish that the routine is as natural to her as turning on the TV, especially when she describes thinking through each step."],"options":["One smooth attempt does not establish that the routine is as natural to her as turning on the TV, especially when she describes thinking through each step.","Her account describes completing the sequence without referring to any prompts or thinking about the steps.","The observer can determine how familiar the routine feels to her from that one successful attempt alone."]},"advanced-native-1975-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["那個人從未學過或練過這個動作。"],"options":["某個動作對所指的人已很熟悉順手。","那個人從未學過或練過這個動作。","需要知道比喻指的是哪一個活動。"]},"advanced-native-1975-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Song selection is as natural to them as turning on the TV, but that does not establish that they can repair a failed download."],"options":["I assumed practising the selection screen also meant they had practised the repair controls.","I would describe the selection routine as unfamiliar simply because the repair step still needs help.","Song selection is as natural to them as turning on the TV, but that does not establish that they can repair a failed download."]},"advanced-native-1975-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Opening the phone camera for his daily photograph of the tree is as natural to him as turning on the TV now. Mr Ho credits his granddaughter’s patient practice sessions, which began after his retirement.","Taking his usual tree photograph has become as natural to him as turning on the TV, Mr Ho says. He wants the story to remember the granddaughter who helped him learn, not to make the skill seem something he had always possessed."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
