ce.","Adults may be driving this early exposure, so I would ask who first suggested the tool before deciding how the use began.","I thought the person holding the device must also have been the first to request it."]},"advanced-native-1979-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["We will be driving this early exposure to the catalogue, so could the invitation make clear that the introduction is optional? I suggest letting students choose a question to explore rather than presenting our plan as something they all requested.","Since we are driving this early exposure, I would like us to describe it as an invitation to try the archive, not a response to a request we have not received. Could students first tell us what they might like to look for?"],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
