at comes with it before accepting the full role."]},"advanced-native-1980-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["I am enjoying the orchestra and learning about everything that comes with it, from the first performance to waiting through rehearsals and putting the stands away. It is more work than I imagined, but that does not take away the pleasure of playing together.","Joining the orchestra has meant accepting everything that comes with it, including repeated practice as well as the excitement of performing. I wanted to tell you about both, rather than make the new experience sound either effortless or miserable."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
