('advanced-native-2006', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-2006-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["It checked timing accounts and corrected a name, while keeping one quotation visibly unconfirmed."],"options":["The revised report treated the remaining quotation as confirmed once the organiser’s name was corrected.","It checked timing accounts and corrected a name, while keeping one quotation visibly unconfirmed.","It confirmed that both witnesses gave exactly the same time before correcting the organiser’s name.","It kept the organiser’s earlier name unchanged and did not compare the witnesses."]},"advanced-native-2006-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The edited version compared the witness accounts and corrected the organiser’s name.","The reporter had checked the timing information from two people.","A name had been corrected, while the uncertain quotation stayed labelled.","The wording was smoother, but the account still showed where confirmation was missing."],"options":["The edited version compared the witness accounts and corrected the organiser’s name.","The reporter had checked the timing information from two people.","A name had been corrected, while the uncertain quotation stayed labelled.","The wording was smoother, but the account still showed where confirmation was missing."]},"advanced-native-2006-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Calling it the edited version does not establish that the quotation was checked; the stated changes concern presentation."],"options":["The description says the editor compared the quotation with the original recording.","Calling it the edited version does not establish that the quotation was checked; the stated changes concern presentation.","The new paragraph order confirms that the quoted speaker approved the wording."]},"advanced-native-2006-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["The label establishes that the account is more accurate than a named earlier version."],"options":["The label establishes that the accou